**/*.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Generated regression-report output, all three --report-format renderers
# (batch notebooks / static HTML / interactive HTML, each with its own raw
# funnel-comparison CSV trace data) -- reproducible from a regression run via
# ModCheck's regression_testing.py, not a stored baseline. Mirrors ModCheck's
# own .gitignore for the same content. Restore any of them with
# restore_reports.py; Testing/Resources/ReferenceResults/ IS the stored
# baseline and stays tracked.
Testing/Resources/Notebooks/
Testing/Resources/HtmlReports/
Testing/Resources/InteractiveReports/

# Nightly cron daemon's own logs and PID file -- see nightly_regression_cron.py.
Testing/Resources/CronLogs/

# Per-case regression run artifacts (2026-09-02). The suite is now driven one
# case per process for restart resilience -- see run_baseline.sh -- which leaves
# a log per case plus its resume state on disk. All reproducible from a run;
# ReferenceResults/ remains the stored baseline and stays tracked.
Testing/Resources/HtmlReports_before/
Testing/Resources/case_*.log
Testing/Resources/baseline.log
Testing/Resources/batch2*.log
Testing/Resources/before_refactor.log
Testing/Resources/jvm_watch.log
Testing/Resources/_done.txt
Testing/Resources/_remaining.txt
Testing/Resources/_args.txt
Testing/Resources/_cases_order.json
Testing/Resources/_probe*.py
Testing/Resources/_worksession/
